'''City Projects''' are world events accessible from {{NPCSprite|Elizabeth}} in the {{zone|Community Center}}. Players are invited to contribute their resources to projects that will, upon their completion, cause updates to the game world (once development has finished). Players who contribute materials are rewarded with [[Fame]], and a special bonus related to the building upon its completion.

'''Players''' can contribute daily to each project. Projects require different contributions to complete.

